Fri Nov  6 19:50:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of TreeSheets 2.23.4
  * wxWidgets 3.3.4 is bundled and linked statically (openSUSE only
    ships 3.2), using the system zlib, expat, pcre2, libjpeg, libpng,
    libtiff and libwebp
  * Lobster 2026.8, wxPdfDocument 1.4.0, Monocypher 4.0.3 and
    libunibreak 8.0 are bundled, as upstream does at configure time
  * Add a lower-case treesheets command
